<!doctype html>
<html lang="en">
<%- include('partials/html-head', {title: "", stylesheet: "/landing.css"}); -%>

<body>
  <div id="app" class="wrap">
    <header>
      <%- include('partials/nav'); -%>
      <div class="spacer"></div>
      <h1 class="page-title"><em>Veenew</em> - <span style="font-weight: normal;">Your calm corner on the web</span></h1>
    </header>

    <section>
      <p class="landing-lead">One calm space for everything you put on the web. Make a personal website, a blog, a status log or a bookmark collection, or mix them all on pages of your own.</p>
      <p>Veenew is a simple blogging platform at its core, but flexible enough for regular blogs, microblogs, bookmarks, essays, journals, personal websites, and everything in between. No follows, no likes, just your thoughts.</p>
      <div class="landing-cta">
        <a class="btn" href="/signup">Get started &rarr;</a>
        <a href="/login">Log in</a>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section>
      <h2 class="landing-heading">Features</h2>
      <div class="features">
        <article class="feature">
          <h3>Unlimited pages</h3>
          <p>Create a page for anything you can imagine, from a personal homepage to a journal or collection of things you love.</p>
        </article>
        <article class="feature">
          <h3>Unlimited posts</h3>
          <p>Write essays, stories, and passing thoughts in Markdown, with links and hashtags.</p>
        </article>
        <article class="feature">
          <h3>Your own style</h3>
          <p>Customize your theme and styling to create a space that feels unmistakably yours.</p>
        </article>
        <article class="feature">
          <h3>Photos</h3>
          <p>Give your favorite memories and everyday snapshots a home with simple photo grids like Instagram.</p>
        </article>
        <article class="feature">
          <h3>Microblogs</h3>
          <p>Share little updates, quick thoughts, and everyday moments without writing a whole post.</p>
        </article>
        <article class="feature">
          <h3>Bookmarks</h3>
          <p>Collect the links, articles, and corners of the web worth coming back to and share it with your readers.</p>
        </article>
        <article class="feature">
          <h3>Guestbook</h3>
          <p>Give visitors a place to say hello, leave a note, share a thought, or simply let you know they stopped by.</p>
        </article>
        <article class="feature">
          <h3>Email subscriptions</h3>
          <p>Let readers subscribe to your writing and receive new posts straight in their inbox.</p>
        </article>
        <article class="feature">
          <h3>RSS feeds</h3>
          <p>Let readers follow your posts through their favorite RSS reader, without algorithms or social feeds.</p>
        </article>
        <article class="feature">
          <h3>Free to use</h3>
          <p>Create pages, publish posts, and make your corner of the web without a monthly subscription.</p>
        </article>
        <article class="feature">
          <h3>Your own domain</h3>
          <p>Give your site its own address with a one-time $36 fee for custom domain support.</p>
        </article>
      </div>
      <div class="landing-cta">
        <a class="btn" href="/signup">Get started &rarr;</a>
      </div>
    </section>

    <%- include('partials/footer'); -%>
  </div>
</body>

</html>
